{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfu6bwToq4L4eX3KJaaKW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I created the dashboard and the alert rule, and both now exist in Kibana. I haven't opened the dashboard to check that every panel shows data, and the rule hasn't run yet: its status is still \"pending\".\n\n**1. What the data holds.** Each record is one web request. Useful fields:\n- `timestamp`: when the request arrived.\n- `response.keyword`: the HTTP response code.\n- `bytes`: response size.\n- `clientip`: the client's IP address.\n- `url.keyword`: the requested page.\n- `geo.src` / `geo.dest`: source and destination country.\n- `machine.os.keyword`: the client's operating system.\n- `extension`: the type of file requested.\n- `agent`: the browser identifier.\n\n**2. Dashboard \"EFF-bc0e4bc5 Web logs overview\"** has 7 panels: http://localhost:15601/app/dashboards#/view/eff-bc0e4bc5-web-logs-overview-6bebdf7c5f4a\n- **Single numbers:** total requests, unique visitors (counted by client IP) and total bytes served.\n- **Requests over time:** a bar chart split by response code.\n- **Response code share:** a pie chart.\n- **Top 10 requested URLs:** a table with request count and average bytes.\n- **Traffic by source country:** the top 10 countries.\n\n**3. Rule \"EFF-bc0e4bc5 5xx spike\"** (id `cf86c0ea-9639-4930-ab8e-9648c977863a`) runs every minute on `kibana_sample_data_logs`. It counts requests whose response code starts with \"5\" over the last 5 minutes, by `timestamp`, and fires when the count is more than 10.\n\nThe rule is switched on, but nothing happens when it fires yet. It has no connector, so add one if you want notifications by email, Slack or similar."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":616,"cache_read_input_tokens":20827,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":616},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0536cbf5-c97a-5467-80bd-e50c5d30a2ce","uuid":"2742e944-2d4e-4e03-9e41-7cd5309eaf68","timestamp":"2026-10-10T19:19:53.276Z","request_id":"req_011Cfu6bwFuFR2AjvijtbG2Y"}
